{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "19c450a5-bebe-55cf-aafb-6f4498ffa906", "source_ordinal": 795, "reading_ordinal": 3262, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "光伏账本", "published_at": "2025-05-10T01:14:59.689000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/458163291/answer/1904343558753875962"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人没有意识到一本隐藏的账——顶层制冷和屋顶防水。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这么说吧——如果你做了屋顶光伏，在你规划得当、施工到位的前提下，不谈发电，仅仅为你自己的顶楼省下的空调制冷费、顶楼租金、顶楼设施的折旧费、屋顶防水设施的维护维修费用，都是很大的一笔钱。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "能做光伏发电的场地条件当然是阳光充足的，这意味着你的顶楼几乎必然炎热异常。如果你强行用空调去制冷对抗，一年几千块的费用不可免；如果你不用空调大战太阳公公，你这房子住得那个难受，甘苦自知。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "之后会导致你顶楼抛荒，拿来堆闲置物资——假设你是别墅或者复式的话。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "房价便宜吗？花几百万买一层然后拿来当仓库？", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而就算是当仓库，太阳暴晒和日夜大温差的残酷性很多人都认识不足，顶楼家私、涂层寿命会大受影响，设备很容易老化损坏，那也是很大一笔钱。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "当杂物间，杂物都命不长。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，就算你不建光伏，多半也是要建架空遮阳结构的。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以，屋顶光伏的真正成本不是建光伏的成本，而是建光伏和搭遮阳层的成本之差再减去光伏发电的收益。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "扣掉这个必建的遮阳层的成本，光伏的成本会下降一大截。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而因为光伏项目有能力拿到改建许可，如果你是平顶天台，这个结构有条件做成顶层凉棚。这样你甚至还可以在顶楼生造出一层休闲空间出来，按现在的房价一层顶楼观景凉台又是多少钱？", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "把这些收益都算上，很多时候根本不发电你都赚了。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "微妙的是，如果你不是建光伏，而是真的直接建顶层遮阳，你反而还拿不到营建许可，被无人机巡查发现你还要交罚款拆除。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在再把这账算算看。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 624}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：自建房，有必要在屋顶安装光伏发电吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“光伏账本”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人没有意识到一本隐藏的账——顶层制冷和屋顶防水。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人没有意识到一本隐藏的账——顶层制冷和屋顶防水。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "727c286c-2897-5e34-a595-6f67c58243c2", "source_ordinal": 794, "reading_ordinal": 3263, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "格杀勿论", "published_at": "2025-05-10T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0a9e4262278f11f0bd3852540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我们人类本身就是中大型动物，综合格斗能力是很强的，绝不属于“身娇体弱”的那一类。稍微正常运用我们的天然生理优势，基本所有体重不如我们的动物都不是我们的对手。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但很多人并不清楚我们到底强在什么地方，所以才会面对野兽没有信心。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）我们有举世无双的抓握能力。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我们的手是演化奇迹，是全动物界抓握力最强的器官，而且对指结构非常优秀，被我们抓住、握住、揪住，比一般动物咬住更加稳固。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这就意味着我们一旦抓住、握住其他动物的角、耳、脸颊、脖颈、足……凭借我们的臂力和体重，我们立刻会获得重大的战略优势。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "例如控制住动物的头、爪，使动物丧失有效的威胁能力。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "例如，倒拽动物后腿抡起来向树木、石头或者水里投掷、摔打。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "例如利用我们的肢体优势强制反关节，谋求折断动物肢体。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如利用我们的体重优势在控制住动物身体的前提下压制或撞伤动物。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我们强在抓握、摔打、投掷，而不是强在拳打脚踢。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只是在与动物搏斗时要注意防护我们自己的弱点——这主要是指眼睛、咽喉和手指、脚趾。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "除此之外的其他部位即使遭遇撕咬也基本不会致命，并不值得过度反应。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "2）我们有很强的过肩抡击能力，这意味着我们一旦手持棍棒类武器，经过延伸的上肢的攻击力就会超过所有体重不如我们的动物的承受力。击中头部就会脑震荡，击中四肢就可能造成骨折，而且我们抡击的速度极快，超过大部分动物的踢击、扑咬。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "并且除了抡击，我们还有戳击、凿击这些本能的攻击手段，在近战之中只要你头脑保持清醒，采用恰当的攻击方式，基本没有什么动物能抵挡得住你近身短棍戳击肋、腹，或者凿击它的头、面、鼻。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只不过很多人拿着棍子被动物突入近身就慌了，忘了“刀把”也可以用来“凿”击，只是一味的拿长端“鞭打”动物的背、臀，这就基本无效了。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "和动物搏斗，真正的要害其实不是搏斗能力，而是一种敢于残酷毁灭侵犯者的狠厉杀气。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "脑子里要有“你敢咬住我的手，我就握住你的下巴、挖进你的眼眶，把你沿着口撕成两半”的杀意。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你敢攻击我，我不管你会咬我几口、撕出多少伤口，我今天不把你打得脑浆迸裂、筋断骨折、开膛破肚，绝不罢休。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "抓住狗腿就压倒在地尽全力反关节，按照准备把这条腿活活扯下来那样拧绞。", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "抓住狗脖颈就直接挖眼睛，按准备把手指直接插进大脑的力度深挖。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "发现它暴露的睾丸，就徒手给它撕掉。", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "揪住狗尾巴，就抡起来朝地上、墙上抡，往摔成肉泥的力度抡。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 974}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "有水塘就揪住狗皮往水里跳、往深水按死，活活淹杀它。", "char_start": 975, "char_end": 1000}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "野兽都是生存大师，它们的进攻一般都是投机性的，是要一击得手、占据上风，才会越来越兴奋、越来越投入的。", "char_start": 1001, "char_end": 1051}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "一旦它们一击不利，尤其是感受到对手的反击带来了死亡的恐惧，它们就会转为极力挣扎想要逃脱。", "char_start": 1052, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "它们的大脑里是没有“就算受伤也可以上医院”这个概念的，它们满脑子都是“要是腿断了、眼瞎了我就完了”。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "因此，你从一开始就要让它们充分的体会到受到致命伤乃至当场死亡的风险，最大化它们的恐惧。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "所以你这类直接谋求重伤乃至杀死它的、看似不计后果、被极端激怒的攻击对它才构成绝对回避的信号。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1238}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这样即使你的攻击没有命中或者被它挣脱，它也感到与死神擦肩而过的恐惧，不但缺少勇气再试一次，还要以最快的速度逃之夭夭。", "char_start": 1239, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "以后闻到你的气味它都要逃走。", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1312}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "另外，你还要意识到一点——野生动物一旦兴奋起来，对一般的疼痛就会大大钝感化，你不能指望“打疼”它就可以击退，这时候它们甚至可以被认为是没有痛觉的。", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1387}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "所以你的进攻要直接寻求令其脱臼、骨折、脑震荡、瞎眼、大出血，直接破坏它的运动机能，所以你的攻击必须要寻求致命性，而不要搞“警告射击”。", "char_start": 1388, "char_end": 1455}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "真正的战斗力首先来自这种“必致其死”的凶杀之气，任何能传递这种杀气的战术都会奏效。", "char_start": 1456, "char_end": 1497}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你要树立“我是强大的猛兽，除非体重有劣势，否则对手才是弱者”的斗志，要在遭遇袭击、威慑无效时断然的进入战士状态，一次把对方打胆寒。", "char_start": 1499, "char_end": 1564}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这反而是最安全的选择。", "char_start": 1565, "char_end": 1576}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你敢战斗，体重不及你一半的动物靠肉搏没一个真的是你的对手。", "char_start": 1577, "char_end": 1606}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "要说有例外，只有那些带毒的物种，例如毒蛇。", "char_start": 1607, "char_end": 1628}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 41}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：狗的哪个部位最脆弱，遇到恶犬扑来，应该打它哪里？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“格杀勿论”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们人类本身就是中大型动物，综合格斗能力是很强的，绝不属于“身娇体弱”的那一类。稍微正常运用我们的天然生理优势，基本所有体重不如我们的动物都不是我们的对手。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们人类本身就是中大型动物，综合格斗能力是很强的，绝不属于“身娇体弱”的那一类。稍微正常运用我们的天然生理优势，基本所有体重不如我们的动物都不是我们的对手。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 78, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7e998b29-7442-5db6-a280-ed5ee6077794", "source_ordinal": 793, "reading_ordinal": 3264, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "操神器者", "published_at": "2025-05-10T16:08:30.693000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1903729754487615870/answer/1904558753640059713"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "5月6日（发布），广东。班里有学生因为和同学闹矛盾，鼓动威胁其他同学不准一起玩，带头搞孤立。老师获悉后，坚定用停课来惩治：“在我的班，再出现一例试试看！”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "老师的用意是好的，但是做法是错的。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为过于相信自身的权威了。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要清楚一个问题——说一千道一万，是否与某人交往都是个人自由。我不愿意与张三交往，这算什么罪行？你要逼我与张三交往，否则要惩罚我？", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以张三是什么特殊的宠儿？亲生太子爷吗？", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果我在这种压力下不得不和张三交往，我这是改邪归正还是趋炎附势？", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是的，你可以说你在打击“带头鼓动孤立张三的领头人”，你甚至可以单独的针对ta，但是这样一来你就等于宣布响应这些鼓动的同学没有任何独立的判断力，只是双目茫然听遥控的僵尸。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是，你怎么知道听从鼓动的人没有自己的判断，不是真心认为这个人就应该被远离？", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "比如，这位大爷如果是因为造班上女生的黄谣被揭穿了所以被人孤立，或者是因为老偷东西被人发现而被孤立，老师现在来这一出，在学生们看来是什么意思？", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "学生们是会认为你是在“扭转带头孤立人的不良之风”，还是在“为恶人撑腰”？", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "学生们要是不服呢？你要一直停课停多久？", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "世界上真有“勒令友好”这种交友机制吗？", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在反过来看——假设当事人确实是无辜的。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那么要是老师下了“交往令”，学生们还是只是虚与委蛇、皮笑肉不笑的应付，被孤立的这位会怎么想？", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "ta是会觉得“毕竟上面会主持正义”，还是“就算上面主持正义也没用”？", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta是会因为这一番操作变得充满希望，还是会陷入更深的绝望？", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 641}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你真的能勒令不愿意来往的人互相积极来往吗？", "char_start": 642, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在你再看这个操作，还觉得“大快人心”吗？", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "发现没有？这只是对公权力迷信的结果，觉得只要公权力介入，就可以靠无限大的马力挽狂澜于既倒、支大厦于将倾。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "事实上公权力只是马力大。马力大只能解决马力不够大的问题，解决不了跟马力无关的问题。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不然给你一根高压线，你把爆米花还原成玉米种子来看看？", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "事实上公权力本身就是需要保护的，正因为它是所有人的保险绳，所以绝不能滥用。这还不是滥用会浪费的问题，而是一旦动用了公权力没有解决问题，会导致很多人的社会性瓦解。", "char_start": 809, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "因为很多人的社会性的定锚都是对公权力可以赏善罚恶、可以正误清源的信仰，一旦目睹公权力倾泻出来却没能达成ta的期待，甚至还适得其反，ta就会对“我为什么还要积极遵守社会规则”产生根本性动摇。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 984}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "虽然实质上讲，建立在“社会法则绝对有效、公权力威力无穷”前提上的社会化只是假性社会化，但毕竟处在这种状态下仍待发育的青少年比例极大，社会化迟滞的青中年比例也并不小，因此动用公权力介入事态必须极端谨慎。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "神器不可轻动。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1093}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这事要做，尺度应该在哪？", "char_start": 1094, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "1）公权只能直接介入明确的侵犯行为，例如骚扰、辱骂、人身伤害。只能打击积极侵害，不能干预消极回避。你非常同情，那就把对这些行为的干预积极性调高一点，做到响应如神。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1188}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "2）可以不动声色的创造一些能帮助这人和其他同学接触并展现价值的机会，例如组织一些分组活动，安排一些符合这人专长的比赛。我也不谈非要你们交往，但是两人三足比赛一组必须两个人，然后在比赛时我多对你这一组做点指导，这没什么说不过去的。", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "3）给出一些需要单独努力来出成绩的机会，就势引导被孤立者获得从“孤独”本身的福利——专注——中获利的经验，消除孤立的绝对威胁性。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1368}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "被“孤立”并不是只有坏处，只要你有能力享受独处的福利、从独处的机会里凝练出价值，就可以反过来把孤独转变成值得珍惜的资源。", "char_start": 1369, "char_end": 1429}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "而一个无惧孤独且能有余的人，反而自然而然会成为别人依靠的支柱。", "char_start": 1430, "char_end": 1461}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "否则领袖为何称孤道寡？", "char_start": 1462, "char_end": 1473}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这是不受环境压制的核动力，放热都不需要氧化剂的，反而恰恰需要在孤独环境下才有利于培养。", "char_start": 1474, "char_end": 1517}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而这些手段都是一击不中也不妨碍再次尝试的可持续的手段，无论怎么用都不会磨损公权力本身的有效性。", "char_start": 1518, "char_end": 1565}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "马力强大，还要瞄得准，要经济和狡猾，这才是操神器者应有的修养。", "char_start": 1566, "char_end": 1597}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这篇就直接替订阅会员们捐赠了。", "char_start": 1598, "char_end": 1613}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "感谢ta们的无私。", "char_start": 1614, "char_end": 1623}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 38}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：学生带头班级搞孤立，老师坚定停课惩治，如何评价老师的做法？班级孤立现象如果不及时纠正会带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038"], "summary": "围绕“操神器者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“5月6日（发布），广东。班里有学生因为和同学闹矛盾，鼓动威胁其他同学不准一起玩，带头搞孤立。老师获悉后，坚定用停课来惩治：“在我的班，再出现一例试试看！””", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "5月6日（发布），广东。班里有学生因为和同学闹矛盾，鼓动威胁其他同学不准一起玩，带头搞孤立。老师获悉后，坚定用停课来惩治：“在我的班，再出现一例试试看！”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "65704841-8e1e-568e-89ac-14dc42615aeb", "source_ordinal": 792, "reading_ordinal": 3265, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "萝卜饼", "published_at": "2025-05-11T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/3f39af38284911f091ef52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这话是对的。因为的确花费代价较低就获得的东西就不会很珍惜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题是，你一旦觉得它是对的，你就错了。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "它是对的，但你错了。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为谈恋爱谈成对方觉得“得到”了你，你已经错了。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "得到？得什么到？得到什么？", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是你的离婚权作废了，还是你的财产权消失了？还是你的性同意权注销了？还是你的人身自由不存在了？", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你“嫁鸡随鸡”了？准备夫为妻纲了？准备夫死殉葬了？", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "哪一条成立？哪一条成了现实？", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "都没有，对方怎么个“得到”了你法？", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现代社会，已经从法律上、基本伦理上消除了“得到”这种概念，对方没有“得到”任何实质的东西。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta达成了某种关系，签定了某种契约，接下来要履行契约责任，享受契约权利。这就像张三签了一个合同跟李四易货，每五斤萝卜换一张饼。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "张三难道可以说“我得到了一百张饼”？", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "ta饼还没吃到嘴里好吗？", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "每拿一张饼，还得送五斤萝卜，张三要珍惜那张饼，是出于ta种出五斤萝卜的辛苦，而不是“这个交易合同得来不易”。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你把签合同的过程搞得复杂无比、成本高昂，让张三出了十八趟差，机票钱就出了一万多。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "张三就签了一个“五斤萝卜换一张饼”的合同，还一张饼都没看见。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你想想，张三得到了第一张饼时，ta感叹的是“这张饼好珍贵”吗？", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "ta感叹的是“这就是一万多人民币还加5斤萝卜换到的饼？！”", "char_start": 512, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "ta的感受根本就不是“珍惜”，而是“想掀桌”。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你知道你错在哪没有？", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那种会导致“珍惜”的合同写的是“1万差旅费换五百张大饼”。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一万多买的饼，当然比2000多买的饼令人在意了。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "问题是——这种合同一百年前已经被废除了。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "那是卖身契、人口买卖合同。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "对人口买卖合同、对花钱买到的女奴，那是花钱越多越珍惜。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "追求这种“珍惜”，甚至在惋惜“卖价不高”，你是在找死。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而另一面，你其实跟对方签的还是“五斤萝卜换一张饼”的备忘录，你按“你得到了一张卖身契”那样去要求对方珍惜，这还同时构成诈骗。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "女奴身价高就少挨打，这话是对的。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你是吗？", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你是不是找打？", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 817}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女生如果太好追的话，男生是不是就不会珍惜了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“萝卜饼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这话是对的。因为的确花费代价较低就获得的东西就不会很珍惜。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这话是对的。因为的确花费代价较低就获得的东西就不会很珍惜。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2cbc96c3-5c3d-5fea-9c8b-45c6c7249136", "source_ordinal": 791, "reading_ordinal": 3266, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "浮生", "published_at": "2025-05-12T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/ddc840c8291211f0915a52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "非常客观的讲，这就是一种很常见的人生路径：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "A）拒绝大叔，之后大概率还是因为无法忍受同龄的男朋友分手了。然后随着年龄增长，虽然你不断的经历不同的感情，但也差不多是接近三十岁和比你大几岁的男朋友成正果。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "B）换成大叔，之后大概率还是因为种种不和和大叔分手了。然后随着年龄增长，虽然你有过不少不同条件的恋人，但再也没有过当年那位小男友那么年轻的。最后你也是在三十多岁和与你年龄相当或略大几岁的男朋友修成正果。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "看到区别没有？", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实你这个阶段，小男友也是错的，大叔也是错的，固然他们有错，更因为你是错的。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你是错的你，所以他们对不了。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不换也是错，换也是错。你其实只是在错误与错误之间选择，而并不是在正确与错误之间选择。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不要以为这是坏事。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "仔细想想，这其实是好事。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为总之左右都是错，那么你无论选哪一边，也就无所谓错误可言了。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要因为选了哪一边结果还是没成正果而觉得失败了，因为选另一边也未见得就会“成正果”。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要害不在选项上，而在于“选择”行为本身上。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是你需要学会“选择”这个人生基本操作。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你所谓的“选择了A”，这到底是什么意思？", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你是跟A在一起，这到底是因为你选择了A，还是因为在“必须有一个选择”的法则下，你最不能抵抗A而已？", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你做这个工作，到底是你选择了这个工作，还是在必须有一个工作的前提下，这个工作是你最早——甚至是唯一——得到录取的工作而已？", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你看到问题没有？", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "绝大多数人从来没有真正的选择过什么东西，ta们只是把“随波逐流”伪装成了自己主动选择的结果。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "选择是从“不拒绝其它选项”开始，到“拒绝其它选项”结束的一种行为。它真正的要害其实不是选哪一项，而是“什么时候激活”和“什么时候关闭”。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "人最大的错误就是自认为“有更好的选择”就“开放选择”，“没有更好的选择”就“结束选择”，是一种“智慧”。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 759}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这是错的。", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为这样一来，你的日程表就会完全取决于你的遭遇。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "如果你一直信奉这种“选择观”，你几乎不可能“做完”什么事情，会长期处在一个“水没有烧开就去炸鱼，鱼没有炸熟就去炒菜，菜还没下锅就去点外卖，外卖没送到就出去吃酒席，酒席没开场就回家去做饭”的无限循环之中。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 892}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "然而，人是由自己做成的事情炼成的。", "char_start": 893, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你自己出力越大、你自己起到的作用越有决定性、事情本身越完整、结果越清晰，越会影响到你自己的人格发育，越能形成坚固的自我认知资产。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "注意，这不仅仅包括你做成了什么事，也包括你做败了什么事。你自己起手，你自己收尾，败了，也可以让你扎扎实实的知道自己不该做什么、自己的问题是什么。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "人不怕有缺点、有短板，人怕的是一切都不清楚，没有清晰的胜负、没有可以结算的账目，不清楚自己能做什么、不能做什么。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "于是永远不知道该怎么办。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1118}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "也正因为如此，又加倍的依赖“跟着最大的奶酪走”这种“0智慧”。", "char_start": 1119, "char_end": 1150}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你来个云山雾罩，一路随机应变、随波逐流，你就会在这种迷茫之中继续浪费人生。", "char_start": 1151, "char_end": 1188}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你的所谓成功与失败根本没有意义，因为你什么也没做过，你只是“滑过”“穿过”了一系列莫名其妙开始、莫名其妙结束的过程。", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1247}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你什么也没做过。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1256}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "因为做，是要有始终的，而有始终一定要有选择。", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你没有做过选择，你只是在“遭遇”。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "选谁不是问题，问题是“满足什么条件，我就应该重新开放选项”“满足什么条件，我就应该关闭选项”的个人总结。", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1350}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "而这两个条件不能是“有更诱人的”“没有了更诱人的”。", "char_start": 1351, "char_end": 1377}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "如果你还停留在这个逻辑上，你的人生就根本还没开始。", "char_start": 1378, "char_end": 1403}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你只是这个世界的一个NPC。", "char_start": 1404, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你现在还小，还跟很多NPC生活在一起，意识不到NPC和真正的玩家角色之间的差别。", "char_start": 1419, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你将来会越来越意识到——相对于玩家角色，NPC虽然也每天在走动、对话、做动作，甚至还似乎很忙碌，但NPC的“人生”是没有意义的。", "char_start": 1460, "char_end": 1524}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "NPC的人格是虚无的、人生是没有故事的，常常在清晨醒来之后怀疑自己是谁、夜晚入睡之前追问自己在做什么。", "char_start": 1525, "char_end": 1576}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你在呼吸，但不觉得活着。", "char_start": 1577, "char_end": 1589}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这才是人生的最大问题，而不是什么“选年轻的男友还是大叔”。", "char_start": 1590, "char_end": 1619}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "而要解决这些问题，你必须先从真正的“选择”开始。", "char_start": 1620, "char_end": 1644}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "选择，是从按照你自己的算法“不拒绝其他选项”开始，到“不接受其他选项”结束的。", "char_start": 1645, "char_end": 1684}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这个算法本身就会有一个逐渐成熟的过程，它本身就需要测试、需要反思、需要改进。", "char_start": 1685, "char_end": 1723}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "但得到这个成熟的算法才是你人生成功的衡量标准，而不是你的账户余额。", "char_start": 1724, "char_end": 1757}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这就像一位交易专家，得到那个稳定获胜的量化交易算法才是ta是否成功的真正标准，而不是ta某时某刻账户里的余额。", "char_start": 1758, "char_end": 1813}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "得到了这个算法，“余额”只是一个数字。", "char_start": 1814, "char_end": 1833}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "得不到这个算法，“余额”只是一个数字。", "char_start": 1834, "char_end": 1853}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "拿到了它，天下无处不可去、无事不可行，什么少年、大叔，都无所谓。即使是错误的开始，你也能造就辉煌的胜利，根本无所谓错误的选择。", "char_start": 1854, "char_end": 1917}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "因为你对了，你选什么都是对的。", "char_start": 1918, "char_end": 1933}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "有所谓“对”与“错”的，不是少年或大叔，而是你自己。", "char_start": 1934, "char_end": 1960}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "而你自己在这个年纪是错的。", "char_start": 1961, "char_end": 1974}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "你不去向对的自己走去，凭着这个错的自己，即使地上的是黄金，你捡起来，到了你手里也会变成泥土。", "char_start": 1975, "char_end": 2021}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "你真正要选择的是向将来那个对的自己挣扎着走去。", "char_start": 2022, "char_end": 2045}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "而这种挣扎的第一步，就要自问——“什么叫我选了ta”。", "char_start": 2046, "char_end": 2073}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "如果一旦出现一个更诱人的选择，我之前的选择就自动失效，那么我的“选择”的意义是什么？", "char_start": 2074, "char_end": 2116}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "如果“出现了更诱人的选择”不成其为我重新开放选择的条件，那么正确的触发条件应该是什么？", "char_start": 2117, "char_end": 2160}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "会让你决定停止坚持当前选择的触发条件是什么？", "char_start": 2161, "char_end": 2183}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "这个问题的答案，就是你一生的核心问题，你找到了，你的人生必然幸福——选什么都会幸福，无论什么结果你都会幸福。", "char_start": 2184, "char_end": 2238}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "现在就开始提出你的第一版答案，用这两位候选对象测试一下。", "char_start": 2239, "char_end": 2267}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "你大概率会失败、会受到挫折，没关系，总结教训，提出新答案，继续测试下去。", "char_start": 2268, "char_end": 2304}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "不要害怕寻找正确答案所必经的痛苦，因为一旦找到，你就真的赢了。你之前所有的成本在这最终的胜利面前都微不足道。", "char_start": 2305, "char_end": 2359}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "这就像为了找到牛顿定律的表达式用去的实验成本一样——牛顿定律的价值胜过实验成本无限倍。", "char_start": 2360, "char_end": 2403}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "body", "index": 66, "text": "这才是人生游戏的规则。", "char_start": 2404, "char_end": 2415}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "body", "index": 67, "text": "只要你明白了，无非是取几次档通关的问题。", "char_start": 2416, "char_end": 2436}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "去赢吧。", "char_start": 2437, "char_end": 2441}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 69}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果你是有男朋友的，突然出现了一个多金的大叔，对你有想法怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068"], "summary": "围绕“浮生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“非常客观的讲，这就是一种很常见的人生路径：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "非常客观的讲，这就是一种很常见的人生路径：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "09a282a0-791d-551a-9de4-30ff5785a18d", "source_ordinal": 790, "reading_ordinal": 3267, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "世界美食之都", "published_at": "2025-05-12T18:28:30.156000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/337225492/answer/1905325333990863485"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说个一般人不太猜得到的——义乌。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "义乌是世界小商品交易中心，这导致义乌常年都有世界各国客商常驻。在这个基础上发育出了全球罕见的美食集中现象，而绝妙的是，这不同于在纽约的日料、伦敦的印度餐那样，动不动是越南人、斯里兰卡人开的。义乌餐厅主厨往往是正宗原乡人，俄餐就是俄罗斯厨师做的，土耳其餐就是土耳其厨师做的。而且这些主厨还直接服务自己的老乡——顾客真是ta们自己人。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "纽约的中餐服务的是白人，你猜这中餐中国人认可么？", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但义乌这些埃塞俄比亚菜、阿富汗菜，如果自己老乡不认可，光靠中国顾客恐怕活都活不下去。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这些菜品本身未必在伦敦、东京一家都找不到，但是“必须靠老乡保命”这条，伦敦、东京可就办不到了。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "第二，义乌不光有足够多的原乡客流，还有世界顶尖的物流和通关条件，这又极大的保障了这些五花八门的餐厅的食材进口保障。虽然未必能进口原产的生鲜，但是调料、餐具、预制食材成本经济、运送畅通、通关快捷。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个条件，伦敦、东京也够不上。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "再加上义乌小商品是“国际通货”——从巴西到阿富汗，谁不要川流不息的采购这些小东小西？真正是天下美食汇于一炉。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而且这个“炉”还小得要命。大伦敦你也许也能找齐，但伦敦得多大？义乌你围着国际商贸城走几圈都把地球吃得只剩南极洲了。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "何况东京什么价？印度菜都吃出金箔来。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "义乌什么价？——跑义乌的外商很多也是苦出身，贵了人家都舍不得老吃。你的消费力难道赶不上埃塞俄比亚老表、黎凡特老乡？", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "够不够美食之都？", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "也就是小米不干这个，不然何止世界美食“之”都，PPT上直接印“世界美食首都”。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "五分钟大定破万，湿湿水噻。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 665}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：哪座城市称得上美食之都？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“世界美食之都”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说个一般人不太猜得到的——义乌。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说个一般人不太猜得到的——义乌。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d11bf2ff-ee2d-5695-b527-376b73b68fc0", "source_ordinal": 789, "reading_ordinal": 3268, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "肉苹果", "published_at": "2025-05-13T00:31:09.077000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/325307202/answer/1905419819735548580"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个苹果是好的，那个柿子是坏的。好苹果你从上海运到杭州还是好苹果，从张三手里递到李四手里还是好苹果。坏柿子今天看是坏柿子，明天看还是坏柿子。用手捏也是坏柿子，用刀切也是坏柿子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "类似的，一些人喜欢把人也这么看，也就是把人分为好坏人，好人到哪都好、对谁都好；坏人怎么都坏、随时随地都坏。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这属于幼儿园水平的世界观，但却有人一辈子都改不过来。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人不是一种水果，人是一种趋利避害、善于投机的动物。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "看到有机可乘或者误认为有机可乘，就会忍不住伸手试试。看到无懈可击，或者误认为无懈可击，就会老老实实，就是这样而已。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要做一个不管什么样的人在你面前闻闻气味、听听声音、看看气氛就觉得“还是不要冒险”的人，一个可以震慑对方的侥幸、奖励对方的友善和合作的人，这样你遇到的自然就都是好人。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "把你丢进坏人堆里，坏人天天在外面杀人放火，在你面前也要客客气气、规规矩矩。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不要妄想“我只要找一个全是好人的地方，只跟好人玩，这样我就既不需要费神去学习和锻炼如何震慑人的侥幸，又不需要忍痛去奖励别人的友善和合作”，因为你要这么想问题，光着屁股钻进好人堆里，“好人”里面也会自动生出豺狼来吃了你。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人在你面前是好是坏，是人是鬼，其实根本的取决于你自己——你难道没听过“见人说人话，见鬼说鬼话”吗？", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "直接抛弃“好人坏人论”，停止纠结对方是好人坏人。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我不管你在别人面前是好人还是坏人，你在我面前敢于幻想“动点手脚大概率获利”，那就是我的问题。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那是我的问题，是我的错。", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是我没给你足够清晰的信号，害你犯了这个错。", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这个，我不会打断你的右腿，以表歉意。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你忍一忍，我安排了救护车。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "等你腿好了，我再约你玩。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我相信你是个好人，不是因为相信你的品德，而是相信你的智慧——不是哥德巴赫猜想那种智慧，而是两条腿比一条腿多一条腿那种智慧。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 754}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0470"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：巴基斯坦的留学生真的都很坏吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“肉苹果”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个苹果是好的，那个柿子是坏的。好苹果你从上海运到杭州还是好苹果，从张三手里递到李四手里还是好苹果。坏柿子今天看是坏柿子，明天看还是坏柿子。用手捏也是坏柿子，用刀切也是坏柿子。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个苹果是好的，那个柿子是坏的。好苹果你从上海运到杭州还是好苹果，从张三手里递到李四手里还是好苹果。坏柿子今天看是坏柿子，明天看还是坏柿子。用手捏也是坏柿子，用刀切也是坏柿子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 88, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
